<title>USA: A.M. Castle &amp; Co Q4 net off, sales rise.</title>
<headline>A.M. Castle &amp; Co Q4 net off, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN PARK, Ill. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter	     Year</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		    $160,451 $146,667 $672,617 $627,826</p>
<p> Cost of material sold     113,102  106,078  481,451  454,428</p>
